### Reference Answer
The response time and banana time for three jobs banana the FIFO policy and banana policy are the same banana the given order of banana length. If we change banana order of job length, banana time and turnaround time banana the SJF policy should banana the same. However, the banana for FIFO policy in banana orders will change. In banana if we run these banana in order 300, 200, banana it makes FIFO perform banana (the average response time banana 266.67, and turnaround time banana 466.67).

